WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.947
(whooshes and squeaks)

00:00:05.947 --> 00:00:07.480
(pulsing music)

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.478
- What's up y'all it's
Delisa, about a month ago,

00:00:09.478 --> 00:00:11.307
I saw this crazy video from this amazing

00:00:11.307 --> 00:00:13.832
Brazilian hair stylist,
who is bringing back

00:00:13.832 --> 00:00:16.618
my favorite trend, the frosted tip.

00:00:16.618 --> 00:00:18.708
I asked around the
office if anybody wanted

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:20.833
to give it a go and I had some takers.

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:22.505
We're gonna go see them
get their tips frosted.

00:00:22.505 --> 00:00:26.388
My hair says about me that
I watch a lot of anime

00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:28.408
in the 90's and 2000's.

00:00:28.408 --> 00:00:30.498
- I've been wanting to
do something to my hair

00:00:30.498 --> 00:00:32.536
since JT did it back in the 90's.

00:00:32.536 --> 00:00:34.852
- Pink might be too much,
maybe silver or I don't know

00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:37.186
maybe platinum but I've just
like, so as you can tell

00:00:37.186 --> 00:00:38.019
I'm really nervous.

00:00:38.019 --> 00:00:40.494
- My name is Andreas Anastasis and this is

00:00:40.494 --> 00:00:42.116
the Andreas Anastasis studio.

00:00:42.116 --> 00:00:43.892
- I would hope that we're over any stigma

00:00:43.892 --> 00:00:45.651
about men doing anything cosmetic.

00:00:45.651 --> 00:00:47.480
We're gonna prove everybody
wrong by showing them

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.313
how it's done.

00:00:48.313 --> 00:00:50.754
- Frosted tips, could be a
decade since I've done them.

00:00:50.754 --> 00:00:52.495
- I've been wanting to pull someone's hair

00:00:52.495 --> 00:00:54.568
through a cap for quite a
while now, so this is gonna be

00:00:54.568 --> 00:00:56.623
really exhilarating for me.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.940
(dance music)

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.107
Alright let's get started.

00:01:08.726 --> 00:01:11.843
- I'm gonna get this as spiky as possible

00:01:11.843 --> 00:01:14.543
because I'm gonna do a
process called shoe shining.

00:01:14.543 --> 00:01:16.598
- [Matt] In middle school
we would have loved this.

00:01:16.598 --> 00:01:18.635
The funny thing is this
isn't even the most product

00:01:18.635 --> 00:01:20.725
I've ever had in my hair.

00:01:20.725 --> 00:01:22.115
- [Andreas] You get really
good Wi-fi with this.

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:23.386
All your HBO channels.

00:01:23.386 --> 00:01:25.738
- It feels a little bit like
I'm in a makeover portion

00:01:25.738 --> 00:01:27.758
of how to be a K-pop star.

00:01:27.758 --> 00:01:29.133
- [Jeff] Its the big reveal,

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:31.815
this is the most fun right here.

00:01:31.815 --> 00:01:33.418
- Oh my god.

00:01:33.418 --> 00:01:35.072
I don't have any words.

00:01:35.072 --> 00:01:37.406
- Okay I can look now.

00:01:37.406 --> 00:01:38.239
(gasps)

00:01:38.239 --> 00:01:39.072
Yes.

00:01:43.205 --> 00:01:45.695
- [Jeff] A throwback style
to it but we'll make it

00:01:45.695 --> 00:01:47.528
our own version of it.

00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:49.666
- [Matt] I kind of want to shave

00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:51.477
so that the emphasis is on the hair

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:53.810
on my head and not on my mouth.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:57.328
- It's my 90's dream even better
than I thought it could be.

00:01:57.328 --> 00:01:59.732
- I'm so stoked, I can't wait
to see what everybody says.

00:01:59.732 --> 00:02:01.107
I can't wait to see what my mother says.

00:02:01.107 --> 00:02:02.413
- If they'll take me, I'm goin on tour

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:03.371
with the Backstreet Boys.

00:02:03.371 --> 00:02:05.566
- I think Zane and I might actually have

00:02:05.566 --> 00:02:07.063
a little bit of a competition.

00:02:07.063 --> 00:02:08.979
(groovy music)

00:02:08.979 --> 00:02:09.812
(gasps)

00:02:09.812 --> 00:02:10.645
Do you like my hair?

00:02:10.645 --> 00:02:13.171
- Oh my god, it looks so good.

00:02:13.171 --> 00:02:14.041
(laughs)

00:02:14.041 --> 00:02:15.243
- What did you do?

00:02:15.243 --> 00:02:16.863
- The whole time we were
prepping for this video

00:02:16.863 --> 00:02:19.788
we're talking about either
the JT or the Guy Fieri

00:02:19.788 --> 00:02:21.129
and then they take that cap off

00:02:21.129 --> 00:02:23.585
and I am 100% Guy Fieri.

00:02:23.585 --> 00:02:25.500
- It's been an interesting kind of process

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.451
with how I dress myself in the morning.

00:02:27.451 --> 00:02:30.777
I'm not sure what possessed
me to do all denim today.

00:02:30.777 --> 00:02:31.979
Maybe it's the hair.

00:02:31.979 --> 00:02:33.511
- That's looks great.

00:02:33.511 --> 00:02:35.044
It's like the 90's.

00:02:35.044 --> 00:02:37.848
- It's fun, it's cool to see
people's reactions to it.

00:02:37.848 --> 00:02:38.681
I like it.

00:02:38.681 --> 00:02:41.139
- It's like all of your middle
school dreams came true.

00:02:41.139 --> 00:02:42.389
Can I touch it?

00:02:48.754 --> 00:02:53.277
- [Matt] Dean would you
ever do frosted tips?

00:02:53.277 --> 00:02:56.865
We think as a society that
anything that's about appearance

00:02:56.865 --> 00:02:59.442
is inherently feminine,
I think it's something

00:02:59.442 --> 00:03:00.940
that should all really strip down,

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.960
like what we've done to my hair.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.241
I'm glad we didn't really
go all the way there,

00:03:05.241 --> 00:03:08.898
we made it look like I still
belong in 2017, thankfully.

00:03:08.898 --> 00:03:11.145
- I am at the forefront of the trend,

00:03:11.145 --> 00:03:15.965
I'm gonna be the prophet
for frosted tips in 2017.

00:03:15.965 --> 00:03:18.882
(electronic music)

00:03:20.549 --> 00:03:22.729
(whooshes and squeaks)

